      "title": "Concepto Teórico: In, On, At",
      "parts": [
        { "visual": "'In' se usa para partes del día (in the morning/afternoon/evening), meses y años.", "audio": "In is used for parts of the day: in the morning, in the afternoon, in the evening; and for months and years." },
        { "visual": "'On' se usa para días de la semana (on Monday) y fechas completas. 'At' se usa para la hora exacta (at 10 AM) y para la noche (at night).", "audio": "On is used for days of the week, like on Monday, and full dates. At is used for exact times, like at 10 AM, and for night, like at night." }
      ]
